   "\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_exposed_2\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\tYou come to an open door. You hear music, voices, and movement within. You peek around the corner. It looks like a party. It'll be hard to get by without anyone noticing, but perhaps if you're quick people will doubt they saw a thing.",
