   "\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_3\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<generate1>><<person1>>",
   "\t\t\t\tA <<person>> accosts you halfway in a stairwell, placing one arm around your waist, gripping your wrist with the other, and pulling you against <<him>>. \"What a cute <<girl>>,\" <<he>> says, shifting your weight to keep you unsteady. <<He>> leans in to kiss.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>",
