   "\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_4\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<generate1>><<person1>>",
   "\t\t\t\tYou pass a <<person>> working as a janitor. <<Hes>> wearing headphones, and doesn't seem to notice you.",
   "\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t<</addinlineevent>>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t<<if $hookah_state is undefined>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_5\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\tThe front door of one of the flats is ajar, and a purple light glows within. You smell a strange incense.<<garousal>><<arousal 600>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<link [[Investigate|Flats Hookah]]>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>><</link>>",
