   "\t\t\t\t\t<<link [[Ignore|Flats]]>><</link>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<br>",
   "\t\t\t\t<</addinlineevent>>",
   "\t\t\t<</if>>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_6\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<generate1>><<person1>>",
   "\t\t\t\tA <<person>> leers openly as <<he>> walks by, turning <<his>> head to look behind <<him>>.",
