   "\t\t\t<</addinlineevent>>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t<<if Time.dayState is \"night\" and Time.isWeekEnd() and !$weekly.flatsCouple>>",
   "\t\t\t\t<<addinlineevent \"flats_11\" 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<npc Bailey 1>><<generatep2>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<if $bailey_partner is undefined>><<set $bailey_partner to 0>><</if>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<set $weekly.flatsCouple to 1>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\tYou hear giggles and clumsy footsteps from a nearby hallway. You suspect a couple returning from a <<print either(\"wild\", \"romantic\")>> night.",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<if $loveInterest.primary isnot \"None\">>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t\tThe thought makes you smile, and your mind drifts to <<if $loveInterest.primary is \"Black Wolf\" or $loveInterest.primary is \"Great Hawk\">>the <</if>>$loveInterest.primary. You wish to share special nights like that with <<nnpc_him $loveInterest.primary>>, too.",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<</if>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t\t\tWhen you reach the end of the hallway, you come across the mysterious lovers. <span class=\"purple\">It's Bailey</span>, <span class=\"lewd\">kissing a <<person2>><<personsimple>> you don't recognise.</span>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t\t\t<<if $rentTime lte 0>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t\tYou sneak away before Bailey notices you. You desperately try to erase the image from your mind. <<gtrauma>><<trauma 3>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\t\t\t\t\t<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>",
   "\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>",
